### 生成沙箱订单场景
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/vendor-direct-fulfillment/sandbox-test-data/2021-10-28/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","body":{"orderScenarios":[]}}

### 查询沙箱订单场景
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/vendor-direct-fulfillment/sandbox-test-data/2021-10-28/transactions/get
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","pathParams":{"transactionId":"TRANSACTION-1"}}
